# Stranglethorn Vale (Horde) - Completionist (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# The Horde side of contested Stranglethorn Vale: the Grom'gol defense and
# Mok'thardin chains, the Nimboya/Yenniku and Kin'weelay/Gurubashi lines, the
# Booty Bay errands, the Tribal Leatherworking writ-class record and the
# Shaman Voodress chain (band 30-47; 5148 and 8116-8119 ride above-band with
# their gates noted). Every accept is on key 1434; the Arathi, Dustwallow,
# Hinterlands, Durotar and Riverglades legs ride honest expedition steps below.
# See docs/stranglethorn-horde-census.md.
guide butler-routes-completionist/stranglethorn-horde
title Stranglethorn Vale (Horde)
levels 30-47
zone Stranglethorn Vale
faction Horde
category Leveling
folder Completionist
coords live
version 1

step Grom'gol, mustering

  note Grom'gol is the Horde hub: Commander Aggro'gosh (32.17, 28.9), Far Seer Mok'thardin (32.12, 29.24), Nimboya (32.16, 27.72) and Kin'weelay (32.27, 27.71) hold the rise with the Bubbling Cauldron (32.22, 27.6) between them. Take the hub's asks here; the jungle fills them.
  goto 32.17,28.9
  accept 568 -- The Defense of Grom'gol - Commander Aggro'gosh; fifteen Lashtail Raptors, ringing the camp
  note 568's raptors fill on the ring sweep below - hand them in on the return.
  accept 570 -- Mok'thardin's Enchantment - Far Seer Mok'thardin; eight Shadowmaw Claws and the Pristine Tigress Fang
  note 570's cats fill on the east-3 leg below (northeast cluster, with Mai'Zoth) - hand them in on the return.
  accept 581 -- Hunt for Yenniku - Nimboya; nine Bloodscalp Tusks, west
  note 581's tusks fill on the first western trip below - hand them in on the return.
  accept 596 -- Bloody Bone Necklaces - Kin'weelay; twenty-five necklaces off the western Bloodscalps
  note 596's necklaces fill across the first two western trips - hand them in when full.
  accept 629 -- The Vile Reef - Kin'weelay; the Tablet Shard off the Gri'lek remains, west
  note 629's shard fills on the first western trip - 95748 opens on the return.
  accept 638 -- Trollbane - Nimboya; Zengu waits in Arathi, late
  note 638's turn-in is an Arathi expedition - the leg below carries it.
  accept 1261 -- Marg Speaks - the Bubbling Cauldron; the Jeweled Pendant and Nazeer, Dustwallow, late
  note 1261's pendant drops only in Dustwallow and its turn-in sits there too - the expedition leg below carries both.
  accept 2932 -- Grim Message - Nimboya; place the message at the Hinterlands point, late
  note 2932's objective is a Hinterlands expedition - the leg below carries it.
  accept 95141 -- Report to Rog'mar - Commander Aggro'gosh; Krom'rosh waits in Riverglades, late
  note 95141's turn-in is a Riverglades expedition - the leg below carries it.
  accept 97453 -- Weed Whacked - Gemmil (Crank in Booty Bay holds the twin starter); six Carnivorous Weeds, ringing the camp
  note 97453's weeds fill on the ring sweep below - Nerrist takes them on the return.

step Grom'gol, the Troll Witchdoctor

  when onquest 1240
  goto 32.27,27.71
  turnin 1240 -- The Troll Witchdoctor - the Defiant Orc Head to Kin'weelay
  note 1240 accepts in the Barrens and lives outside this tracker's list - turn it in here if the log carries it.

step Grom'gol ring - raptors and weeds

  complete 568 @32.97,23.89 era -- fifteen Lashtail Raptors for Commander Aggro'gosh, ringing the camp
  note The raptors range around (30-39, 19-28) - work the ring for all fifteen.
  complete 97453 @33.51,27.63 era -- six Carnivorous Weeds for Nerrist, around the camp
  note The weeds ring the camp around (31-37, 22-33) - work the ring for all six.

step Grom'gol, first return

  goto 32.17,28.9
  turnin 568 -- The Defense of Grom'gol - the raptors to Commander Aggro'gosh
  accept 569 -- The Defense of Grom'gol - Commander Aggro'gosh; Mosh'Ogg Brutes and Witch Doctors, east
  note 569 waited on 568's turn-in - its camp fills on the way west below.
  turnin 97453 -- Weed Whacked - the weeds to Nerrist
  note 97453's Booty Bay twin starter (Crank) is not this guide's - the Grom'gol start above is the routed one.

step West - Bloodscalp country, first trip

  complete 569 @37.17,30.63 era -- ten Mosh'Ogg Brutes for Commander Aggro'gosh, east of the camp
  note The brutes cluster around (35-38, 30-32), on the way west.
  complete 569 @37.01,28.69 era -- five Mosh'Ogg Witch Doctors for Commander Aggro'gosh, with the brutes
  note The witch doctors work around (36-38, 28-32) - clear them with the brutes.
  collect 3901 x9 @25.6,10.59 era -- nine Bloodscalp Tusks off the Bloodscalps for Nimboya, west
  note The Bloodscalps range the west around (19-34, 8-21) - work the villages for the tusks; the necklaces (596) fill on the same kills.
  collect 3915 @25.6,10.59 era -- Bloody Bone Necklaces off the western Bloodscalps for Kin'weelay
  note The necklaces drop at 17% - farm them across this trip and the next; hand them in when the twenty-five are full.
  collect 4094 @24.77,22.88 era -- the Tablet Shard off the Gri'lek remains for Kin'weelay, west
  note The shard sits on the Gri'lek objects (npcs.json point; spawnz carries no entry) - 95748 opens back at the hub.
  note The Third Troll Legend rubbing (95748) and the headhunting (582) ride the next western trip - their pres open on the return below.

step Grom'gol, second return

  goto 32.17,28.9
  turnin 569 -- The Defense of Grom'gol - the Mosh'Ogg dead to Commander Aggro'gosh
  accept 97386 -- The Offense of Grom'gol - Commander Aggro'gosh; the four Mosh'Ogg kinds, east
  note 97386 waited on 569's turn-in - its camp fills on the east-3 leg below.
  turnin 581 -- Hunt for Yenniku - the tusks to Nimboya
  accept 582 -- Headhunting - Nimboya; twenty Shrunken Heads, west
  note 582 waited on 581's turn-in - its heads fill on the next western trip.
  turnin 629 -- The Vile Reef - the shard to Kin'weelay
  accept 95748 -- The Gurubashi Legends of Old - Kin'weelay; the rubbing at the Fall of Gurubashi, west
  note 95748 waited on 629's turn-in - its rubbing fills on the next western trip.

step West - heads and the rubbing, second trip

  collect 1532 x20 @22.7,10.79 era -- twenty Shrunken Heads off the Bloodscalp Headhunters for Nimboya, west
  note The headhunters work around (20-24, 8-13) - farm them for all twenty heads.
  collect 3915 @22.7,10.79 era -- more Bloody Bone Necklaces off the western Bloodscalps for Kin'weelay
  note Finish the twenty-five here if the first trip left any short - 598 opens on the return.
  collect 2007 @22.95,12.02 era -- the Third Troll Legend rubbing at the Fall of Gurubashi for Kin'weelay, west
  note The rubbing comes off the Fall of Gurubashi object - 95770 and 95773 open on the return.
  note Gan'zulah, Nezzliok (584), the Drowned City entrance (95770) and the tridents (95773) ride the next western trip - their pres open on the return below.

step Grom'gol, third return

  goto 32.16,27.72
  turnin 582 -- Headhunting - the heads to Nimboya
  accept 584 -- Bloodscalp Clan Heads - Nimboya; Gan'zulah's and Nezzliok's heads, west, for the Cauldron
  note 584 waited on 582's turn-in - its heads fill on the next western trip.
  turnin 596 -- Bloody Bone Necklaces - the necklaces to Kin'weelay
  accept 598 -- Split Bone Necklace - Kin'weelay; twenty-five split necklaces, Skullsplitter country east
  note 598 waited on 596's turn-in - its necklaces fill on the east trip below.
  turnin 95748 -- The Gurubashi Legends of Old - the rubbing to Kin'weelay
  accept 95770 -- Locating the Lost City - Kin'weelay (the Cauldron starts it too); find the Drowned City entrance, west
  note 95770 waited on 95748's turn-in - its entrance fills on the next western trip.
  accept 95773 -- Enemies in the Water - Commander Aggro'gosh (Nimboya holds the twin starter); ten Brinescale Tridents, west coast
  note 95773 waited on 95748's turn-in - its tridents fill on the next western trip. The Nimboya twin is not this guide's - the Aggro'gosh start above is the routed one.

step West - the heads and the Drowned City, third trip

  collect 3904 @23.44,8.12 era -- Gan'zulah's Head for the Cauldron, west
  collect 3905 @23.52,9.53 era -- Nezzliok's Head for the Cauldron, west
  note The two heads come off Gan'zulah and Nezzliok themselves, side by side in the west.
  complete 95770 @22.38,27.13 era -- find the Drowned City entrance for Kin'weelay, west
  note The entrance event sits at the data-placed point - 95775 opens on the return.
  collect 270305 x10 @20.84,20.82 era -- ten Brinescale Tridents off the Skirmishers for Commander Aggro'gosh, west coast
  note The skirmishers line the coast around (13-31, 14-34) - work the shore for all ten tridents.
  note The twins (585/586) and the tablets (95775) ride the hub and the east below - their pres open on the return.

step Grom'gol, fourth return

  goto 32.22,27.6
  turnin 584 -- Bloodscalp Clan Heads - the heads to the Bubbling Cauldron
  accept 585 -- Speaking with Nezzliok - the Bubbling Cauldron; three Skullsplitter trophies, east
  note 585 waited on 584's turn-in - its trophies fill on the east trip below.
  accept 586 -- Speaking with Gan'zulah - the Bubbling Cauldron; Skullsplitter kills and Ana'thek's armor, east
  note 586 waited on 584's turn-in (twin of 585; 588 needs both) - its kills fill on the same east trip.
  turnin 95770 -- Locating the Lost City - the entrance found, to Kin'weelay
  accept 95775 -- The Drowned City - Kin'weelay; four rubbings of the I'lalai tablets
  note 95775 waited on 95770's turn-in - its tablets name no placed spawn anywhere in the data, so have all four (items 270308-270311) in your bags.
  turnin 95773 -- Enemies in the Water - the tridents to Commander Aggro'gosh
  accept 95776 -- The Only Good Brinescale... - Commander Aggro'gosh; Var'Taka, in the Drowned City
  note 95776 waited on 95770 and 95773 together - Var'Taka has no placed spawn anywhere in the data, so complete it here at Aggro'gosh with the note.
  complete 95776 @32.17,28.9 era -- Var'Taka for Commander Aggro'gosh, accounted at the giver
  turnin 95776 -- The Only Good Brinescale... - Var'Taka slain, to Commander Aggro'gosh

step East - Skullsplitter country, first trip

  collect 3906 @46.13,32.33 era -- the Balia'mah Trophy off its skull for the Cauldron, east
  collect 3907 @42.21,36.11 era -- the Ziata'jai Trophy off its skull for the Cauldron, east
  collect 3908 @47.65,39.54 era -- the Zul'Mamwe Trophy off its skull for the Cauldron, east
  note The three trophy skulls stand around (42-48, 32-40) - work them on one sweep.
  complete 586 @45.04,39.56 era -- eight Skullsplitter Hunters for the Cauldron, east
  complete 586 @47.58,42.9 era -- six Skullsplitter Headhunters for the Cauldron, east
  complete 586 @44.25,44.84 era -- four Skullsplitter Berserkers for the Cauldron, east
  note The Skullsplitters range around (43-48, 38-45) - work the ruins for all three kinds.
  collect 3909 @44.3,45 era -- Ana'thek's Broken Armor for the Cauldron, east
  note Ana'thek the Cruel stands at the single point - his armor doubles for 598's split necklaces below.
  collect 3916 x25 @44.3,45 era -- Split Bone Necklaces off Ana'thek and the Skullsplitters for Kin'weelay
  note The split necklaces drop at 10% - farm them with the 586 kills; hand them in on the return.
  note The basilisk crystals (589) and the Mind's Eye (591) ride the next east trip - their pres open on the return below.

step Grom'gol, fifth return

  goto 32.22,27.6
  turnin 585 -- Speaking with Nezzliok - the trophies to the Bubbling Cauldron
  turnin 586 -- Speaking with Gan'zulah - the kills and the armor to the Bubbling Cauldron
  accept 588 -- The Fate of Yenniku - the Bubbling Cauldron; Kin'weelay takes the word
  note 588 waited on 585 and 586 together - it carries no objectives, so hand it straight over.
  turnin 588 -- The Fate of Yenniku - to Kin'weelay
  accept 589 -- The Singing Crystals - Kin'weelay; three Pulsing Blue Shards off the Ironjaw Basilisks, east
  note 589 waited on 588's turn-in - its shards fill on the next east trip.
  turnin 598 -- Split Bone Necklace - the necklaces to Kin'weelay
  turnin 95775 -- The Drowned City - the four rubbings to Kin'weelay
  accept 96078 -- A Tale Spun Around the Fire - Kin'weelay; Master Gadrin waits in Durotar, late
  note 96078 waited on 95775's turn-in - its turn-in is a Durotar expedition, late, and closes the Gurubashi line.

step East - basilisks, second trip

  collect 3911 x3 @43.01,49.16 era -- three Pulsing Blue Shards off the Ironjaw Basilisks for Kin'weelay, east
  note The basilisks cluster around (41-44, 45-49) - work the flats for all three shards.
  note The Mind's Eye (591) rides the next east trip - its pre opens on the return below.

step Grom'gol, sixth return

  goto 32.27,27.71
  turnin 589 -- The Singing Crystals - the shards to Kin'weelay
  accept 591 -- The Mind's Eye - Kin'weelay; the Mind's Eye off Mai'Zoth, far east
  note 591 waited on 589's turn-in - Mai'Zoth waits on the next east trip.

step East - Mai'Zoth and the Mosh'Ogg, third trip

  collect 3838 x8 @48.69,22.22 era -- eight Shadowmaw Claws off the panthers for Mok'thardin, northeast
  note The panthers range the northeast around (45-50, 20-29) - work the hills for the claws; the Fang (3839) drops off the Tigresses on the same kills.
  collect 3839 @48.69,22.22 era -- the Pristine Tigress Fang off the Tigresses for Mok'thardin, northeast
  complete 97386 @50.19,27.73 era -- Mosh'Ogg Maulers for Commander Aggro'gosh, at the Ogre Mound
  complete 97386 @48.76,31.47 era -- Mosh'Ogg Warmongers for Commander Aggro'gosh, at the mound
  complete 97386 @50.34,31.03 era -- Mosh'Ogg Spellcrafters for Commander Aggro'gosh, at the mound
  note The Mosh'Ogg work the mound around (46-52, 24-31) - the Shamans hold the same ground; the data names no counts, so clear the camp. 97386 closes the Grom'gol defense.
  collect 3616 @52.93,27.6 era -- the Mind's Eye off Mai'Zoth for Kin'weelay, far east
  note Mai'Zoth holds the single eastern point - take the Eye and head home.
  note Mok'thardin's second ask (572) opens on the return - its feathers lie west-center.

