  accept 572 -- Mok'thardin's Enchantment - Mok'thardin; ten Jungle Stalker Feathers, west-center
  note 572 waited on 570's turn-in - its feathers fill on the west-center leg below.
  turnin 97386 -- The Offense of Grom'gol - the mound cleared, to Commander Aggro'gosh

step West-center - stalkers

  collect 3863 x10 @27.6,50.28 era -- ten Jungle Stalker Feathers off the Stalkers for Mok'thardin, west-center
  note The stalkers range around (23-34, 36-51) - work the woods for all ten feathers.

