  collect 3862 @30.85,60.03 era -- the Aged Gorilla Sinew off the Elder Mistvale Gorillas for Mok'thardin, south
  note The elders range the south around (30-34, 57-68) at a 5% sinew rate - work the vale for the sinew.
  goto 39.02,58.35
  accept 593 -- Filling the Soul Gem - Yenniku; fill the Soul Gem at his side
  note 593 waited on 592 (held since the seventh return) - the Soul Gem itself names no source anywhere in the data, so it rides with the accept; the repeatable flag covers re-farming, not this completion.
  complete 593 @39.02,58.35 era -- fill the Soul Gem for Yenniku, at his side
  turnin 593 -- Filling the Soul Gem - the filled gem to Yenniku
  note 592's Filled Soul Gem (item 3913) comes out of this turn-in - carry it north.
  collect 3913 @39.02,58.35 era -- the Filled Soul Gem from Yenniku for Nimboya

