step South - the Naga gorge, second trip

  complete 573 @25.07,63.69 era -- ten Naga Explorers for Mok'thardin, on the south coast
  note The explorers line the coast around (23-28, 58-64) - work the shore for all ten.
  collect 737 @28.96,61.93 era -- the Holy Spring Water for Mok'thardin, south
  note The water comes off the Holy Spring object - 573 closes back at the hub.

step Grom'gol, home from the south

  goto 32.12,29.24
  turnin 573 -- Mok'thardin's Enchantment - the gorge cleared, to Mok'thardin
  note Mok'thardin's line closes here - Booty Bay and the expeditions are all that remain.

step Booty Bay, the engineers' minis

  when onquest 2842
  goto 27.6,77.48
  turnin 2842 -- Chief Engineer Scooty - Sovik's word to Scooty
  accept 2843 -- Gnomer-gooooone! - Scooty; wait for the calibration
  note Holders of 2842 turn in here first, then take 2843 on the same terms as the step below.

step Booty Bay, the Gnome mini

  when onquest 3635
  goto 28.36,76.35
  turnin 3635 -- Gnome Engineering - Graham's word to Oglethorpe Obnoticus
  accept 3642 -- The Pledge of Secrecy - Oglethorpe Obnoticus; sign on as a Gnome Engineer
  note Holders of 3635 turn in here first, then take the pledge on the same terms as the Engineering step below (which gates the skill).

step Booty Bay - Scooty and Oglethorpe

  note Booty Bay holds the south's errands: Scooty (27.6, 77.48) calibrates the transponder and Oglethorpe Obnoticus (28.36, 76.35) signs the pledge. Take both asks here; both turn in here.
  goto 27.6,77.48
  accept 2843 -- Gnomer-gooooone! - Scooty; wait for the calibration
  note 2843 needs 2842 (Chief Engineer Scooty, Orgrimmar-routed) done - take it here if that leg sent you in.
  complete 2843 @27.6,77.48 era -- wait for Scooty to calibrate the Goblin Transponder
  turnin 2843 -- Gnomer-gooooone! - back to Scooty
  goto 28.36,76.35
  note Oglethorpe's pledge line (3642/3643) needs Gnome Engineering (3635, Undercity-routed, or its Barrens twin 3637) done - engineers take it in the pledge step below (and the mini above); 3645 (Membership Card Renewal, Ironforge-keyed, no objectives) is an uncontracted extra.

step Booty Bay - the pledge (Engineering)

  when skill Engineering 1

  goto 28.36,76.35
  accept 3642 optional -- The Pledge of Secrecy - Oglethorpe Obnoticus; sign on as a Gnome Engineer
  note 3642 needs the engineer's hands and a finished Gnome line (3635 or 3637) - skip it without both. Have the pledge (item 11282) in your bags.
  turnin 3642 optional -- The Pledge of Secrecy - the signed pledge to Oglethorpe Obnoticus
  accept 3643 optional -- Show Your Work - Oglethorpe Obnoticus; the crafted materials
  note 3643 waited on 3642's turn-in - have the tubes, scope and dummies (items 10559, 4407, 4392) in your bags.
  turnin 3643 optional -- Show Your Work - the materials to Oglethorpe Obnoticus

step North - Se'Jib's arts (Leatherworking)

  when skill Leatherworking 1

  goto 36.55,34.09
  accept 5148 optional -- Tribal Leatherworking - Se'Jib; a Wild Leather Vest and Helmet
  note 5148 needs the leatherworker's hands and 2860 (Master of the Wild Leather, Feralas accept, unrouted) done - skip it without both. Its vest and helmet are crafted and name no source anywhere in the data, so have them (items 8211, 8214) in your bags. Its excl twins (5145/5146, other specializations) are not this guide's.
  turnin 5148 optional -- Tribal Leatherworking - the vest and helmet to Se'Jib

