  accept 8116 only Shaman -- Vision of Voodress - Maywiki of Zuldazar; Zandalar's word
  turnin 8116 only Shaman -- Vision of Voodress - back to Maywiki of Zuldazar
  accept 8117 only Shaman -- Vision of Voodress - Maywiki of Zuldazar; the first vision
  turnin 8117 only Shaman -- Vision of Voodress - the vision to Maywiki of Zuldazar
  accept 8118 only Shaman -- Vision of Voodress - Maywiki of Zuldazar; the second vision
  turnin 8118 only Shaman -- Vision of Voodress - the vision to Maywiki of Zuldazar
  accept 8119 only Shaman -- The Unmarred Vision of Voodress - Maywiki of Zuldazar; the unmarred vision
  turnin 8119 only Shaman -- The Unmarred Vision of Voodress - the vision to Maywiki of Zuldazar

